                <invention-title lang="de">VERFAHREN ZUR HERSTELLUNG EINES FESTSTAHLROTORS</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">PROCÉDÉ DE FABRICATION D'UN ROTOR EN ACIER MASSIF</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">METHOD OF MANUFACTURING A SOLID STEEL ROTOR</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An induction rotor (300) for a motor is provided. The induction rotor comprises a steel rod (301) having a surface. A conductive cladding comprises a clad material (302) and surrounds the surface of the steel rod (301). The conductive cladding (302) forms recessed short circuit rings (305) on the solid steel rod (301).</p>
            </abstract>
